If an implementation-consideration is for a recommendation then the implementation-consideration should inform a clinician-patient-decision for the recommendation.
If there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician does not rigidly follow an implementation-consideration.
If there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician does not inflexibly follow an implementation-consideration.
Every implementation-consideration offers a practical-insight and offers a recommendation-context and offers a specific-example.
